title: Denial Intelligence › A denial opened › Status banner
route: /denials?id=D-3318
intro: One banner under the header says where the denial stands. The code checks the statuses in this order and shows the first that fits. A filed appeal has a button to record the payer's decision.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A denial is on screen"
decision d1 "Accepted?"
toast t1 "'Closed. You accepted the decision'\n'Reason: ... Analytics logs it as an accepted denial.'"
click c1 "Click 'Plan the step-down'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Case Manager › Active cases › Step-down plans from accepted denials"

decision d2a "Payer's decision on the appeal recorded as Overturned or Partly overturned?"
toast t2a "'Overturned on appeal' or 'Partly overturned on appeal'\nYour note, or 'The ledger is updated and the next review is booked.'"
click c2a "Click 'See on the Dashboard'"

decision d2 "Call outcome logged as Overturned or Partly restored?"
toast t2 "'Overturned on the call' or 'Partly restored on the call'\nYour note, or 'The ledger is updated and the next review is booked.'"
click c2 "Click 'See on the Dashboard'"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard › Request drawer › Open and read a request"

decision d3 "Chip is 'Appeal filed', 'Second-level appeal filed' or 'External review'?"
toast t3 "'Appeal filed. Waiting on the payer' (or 'Second-level appeal filed', 'External review')\n'Filed 10/05, decision 11/02. Navigator checks every day. When the payer answers, record the decision here.'"
click c3 "Click 'View the appeal'"
click c3a "Click 'Record the payer's decision'"
goto g3 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › After filing"
goto g3a "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Record the payer's decision"

decision d4 "Chip is 'Appeal drafting'?"
decision d5 "Has a draft been saved?"
toast t4 "'The appeal is drafted and waiting for a clinician's signature'\n'Review the letter, change anything you like, then sign and file.'"
toast t5 "'Advocate is drafting the appeal'\n'Open the draft to see it come together.'"
click c4 "Click 'Open the draft'"
goto g4 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Confirm and draft"

decision d6 "Chip is 'Call booked'?"
toast t6 "'Call booked: Wed 10/21, 9–11 am'\n'Cadence booked the window with Cardinal. The brief is ready, written by Advocate and checked by Integrity.'"
click c5 "Click 'Change the time'"
click c6 "Click 'Open the brief'"
goto g5 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › Book the call"
goto g6 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer › The brief"

process p1 "No banner\nChips 'Analyzed' and 'Resubmitting' have none"
screen sc1 "'Your options' card shows when the denial is still open"
process p2 "Calls booked at the start show the time from the denial's data\nLater ones show the time that was picked"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Yes| t1 --> c1 --> g1
d1 -->|No| d2a
d2a -->|Yes| t2a --> c2a --> g2
d2a -->|No| d2
d2 -->|Yes| t2 --> c2 --> g2
d2 -->|No| d3
d3 -->|Yes| t3 --> c3 --> g3
t3 --> c3a --> g3a
d3 -->|No| d4
d4 -->|Yes| d5
d5 -->|Yes| t4 --> c4
d5 -->|No| t5 --> c4
c4 --> g4
d4 -->|No| d6
d6 -->|Yes| t6 --> c5 --> g5
t6 --> c6 --> g6
t6 -.-> p2
d6 -->|No| p1 --> sc1
